tion/math-academy-id "q-319917" :question/problem "Calculate $CB-CA$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -5\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n|  |  | $0$ | {{field-1}} | $0$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $CB-CA=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} | $0$ | {{field-3}} |  |\n|  |  | $0$ | {{field-4}} | $0$ |  |" :question/worked-solution "We apply the distributive law\n\n$$\nCB-CA=C(B-A).\n$$\n\nSo, compute $B-A$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B-A & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -5\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-3{I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CB-CA & =C(B-A) \\\\  & =C(-3{I}_{3}) \\\\  & =-3C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299808 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e9da96a1-344c-5f5e-a46c-8a86b727fdf5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298547}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298547} :answer-field/id #uuid "116521de-0adb-5a98-b423-99337450df86" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298701} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "71d4223f-d072-595c-a7da-6966340f5b77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298043}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298043} :answer-field/id #uuid "be4a571d-2431-5458-90ca-a3137f93b385" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answe