8 & 1 \\\\ 9 & 17 & 9 & \\boxed{0} \\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The entry lies at the intersection of the $3$rd row and $4$th column. Hence, we have ${a}_{34}=0.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186493306 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cf4f224d-16bc-5f88-9964-8c4bd0e3fc1d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493301}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493301} :answer-field/id #uuid "184a3300-772b-5eed-84cd-901af8115339" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493303} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d4f92cba-5fce-5d2e-ab96-e3096fc08fdc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493302}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493302} :answer-field/id #uuid "50856390-925f-56d7-b022-765ff7c4aaea" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493304}] :question/id #uuid "a2f5866f-d95d-5ce1-abb7-e6bec4ff9ff0" :question/problem "$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}\\bbox[lightgray, 2pt]{0} & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIn index notation, the highlighted entry of the matrix $P$ above is ${p}_{ij},$ where$\\,$\n\n$i=$\n\n{{field-1}}\n\nand\n$j=$\n\n{{field-2}}\n\n." :question/worked-solution "The entry ${p}_{ij}$ lies at the intersection of the $1$st row and $1$st column. Hence, we have $i=1$ and $j=1.$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Describing an Entry of a Matrix in Index Notation"}] :topic/math-academy-id 1167 :topic/title "Index Notation for Matrices"}]}
